sequenceDiagram
  participant User as Demo command
  participant Mock as Loopback mock platform
  participant API as Registry API
  participant Pipeline as Discovery and evidence pipeline
  participant DB as SQLite registry and graph
  User->>Mock: Start synthetic peers on a free port
  User->>API: Register Security, Research, CV, Coordinator
  API->>DB: Save operator registrations
  User->>API: Run A2A, MCP, Kubernetes, API discovery
  API->>Mock: Read cards; initialize MCP and list tools
  Mock-->>API: Declared metadata
  API->>Pipeline: Normalize, fingerprint, classify, deduplicate
  Pipeline->>DB: Persist evidence and capabilities
  User->>API: Ingest synthetic behavior and delegation
  API->>Pipeline: Evaluate combined behavior
  Pipeline->>DB: Refresh agents; identify shadow service and child
  User->>API: Import explicit transient-child creation metadata
  API->>DB: Explain child subtype; preserve unregistered state
  User->>API: Approve known agents; scan health
  API->>Mock: Explicit health requests
  User->>API: Search and match code-security task
  API-->>User: Eligible agents and reasons
  User->>API: Route synthetic task via A2A
  API->>Mock: message/send
  Mock-->>API: Explicitly synthetic result
  API-->>User: Result and selected protocol
  User->>API: Fetch records, graph, and shadow report
  API-->>User: Full evidence
  User->>User: Compute measured metrics; write JSON and Markdown
